# L §6.1 The joint model's own movements (SF-32): "it is booked there only where same or fulfils links it to the member's
# own movement there. Otherwise it is not booked there. A read of that place in the joint model from the movement's
# day until the member's next reading of the place, a balance included, is a hole naming it ...; from that reading
# on, the reading states the balance ... Every result that reads the place on or after the movement's day lists it
# under left out:".  The migrator's F-j (t9/J against t9/K): the joint's own row fb[f1], of the same amount as the member's own row (100.00 DUK), goes into a.sav,
# which the member's version covers and anchors (100.00 DUK at 2025-12-31 end), with no same and no fulfils.  As K
# (the member only pads): 2025-10-01 is the hole naming fb[f1], 2025-12-31 the reading's 100.00 DUK, fb[f1] listed.
# Before: fb[f1] dropped in silence (an end at a place another version covers is not booked from it, and the SF-32
# hole went with it): both reads 100.00 DUK and no left out: line.
=== J/j.tally
model fam
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "../M" sha256 "c13cc94599f2578b0203d1f70e0ce736f2b692e2ff8f7932c1734f58e702b146"

source fsrc "test"

input fb: observed

ask j1: bal(a.sav, 2025-12-31), bal(a.sav, 2025-10-01) law 2026-01-15 as known 2026-01-15

version f
  cite fsrc
  governs 2025-06..2025-12
  known 2026-01-15
  fb[f1] = (on: 2025-06-16, kind: transfers, leg cash from a.world to a.sav amount 100.00 DUK) "f1"
=== M/m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source src "test"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place sav: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..

input sb: observed

version open
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  opening[sav] = 0 at 2025-01-01 start

version s
  cite src
  governs 2025-06..2025-12
  known 2026-01-15
  covers sav
  anchor sav
  sb[s1] = (on: 2025-06-16, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to sav amount 100.00 DUK) "s1"
  stated[sav] = 100.00 DUK at 2025-12-31 end "last"
=== expect
j1: (100.00 DUK, ?"fb[f1] crosses to a with no link" (fb[f1]))
  anchor: a.sav 2025-12-31 end, stated 100.00 DUK, difference ?"fb[f1] crosses to a with no link" (fb[f1])
  left out: fb[f1], 1 instances, first 2025-06-16
  law date 2026-01-15, cut 2026-01-15
